  <diagram name="Página-1" id="AkKDoKO8uJzLmanq3kA4">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1654" dy="805" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="827" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;sequenceDiagram\n    autonumber\n    actor Usuario\n    participant Frontend as Angular (Frontend)\n    participant FaceAPI as face-api.js (WASM / ResNet-34)\n    participant API as API Gateway\n    participant Lambda as AWS Lambda (Node.js)\n    participant DB as Amazon DynamoDB\n\n    Usuario-&gt;&gt;Frontend: 1. Ingresa Email e Inicia Sesión\n    Frontend-&gt;&gt;FaceAPI: 2. Captura frame y extrae Vector de Verificación\n    Frontend-&gt;&gt;API: 3. Petición POST /login (Email, Vector)\n    API-&gt;&gt;Lambda: 4. Invoca Lambda (Servicio de Auth)\n    Lambda-&gt;&gt;DB: 5. GetItem: Recupera Vector Maestro asociado al Email\n    Lambda-&gt;&gt;Lambda: 6. Calcula Distancia Coseno\n\n    alt Match Exitoso (Distancia &lt; Umbral)\n        Lambda-&gt;&gt;Lambda: 7. Genera OTP de 6 dígitos y aplica Hash\n        Lambda-&gt;&gt;DB: 8. PutItem: Email, Hash(OTP), TTL\n        Lambda--&gt;&gt;Frontend: 9. Responde HTTP 200 OK (Requiere OTP)\n        Frontend-&gt;&gt;Usuario: 10. Despliega MatDialog (Angular Material) para código\n        Usuario-&gt;&gt;Frontend: 11. Introduce el código OTP\n        Frontend-&gt;&gt;API: 12. Petición POST /login/verify-otp (Email, OTP)\n        API-&gt;&gt;Lambda: 13. Invoca Lambda (Validador MFA)\n        Lambda-&gt;&gt;DB: 14. GetItem usando PartitionKey(Email)\n        Lambda-&gt;&gt;Lambda: 15. Compara Hashes criptográficos\n        \n        alt Hash Coincide y no expirado\n            Lambda-&gt;&gt;DB: 16. DeleteItem (Prevención ataques Replay)\n            Lambda--&gt;&gt;Frontend: 17. Responde HTTP 200 OK (Set-Cookie: JWT HttpOnly)\n        else Hash Inválido o vacío\n            Lambda--&gt;&gt;Frontend: 17b. Responde HTTP 401 Unauthorized\n        end\n    else Fallo Biométrico\n        Lambda--&gt;&gt;Frontend: 7b. Responde HTTP 401 Unauthorized\n        Frontend-&gt;&gt;Usuario: 8b. Muestra error: Identidad no verificada\n    end&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="SW0ME3lgN8CoHkeJQEvZ-193">
